{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Controls_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering Blade Blitz Demo is a breeze with intuitive controls enabling you  to start slicing and dicing with just a joystick and two buttons. It's recommended you enjoy the demo's tutorial before jumping in to understand the rules of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Local_Multiplayer_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Couch Competitive Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blade Blitz Demo let's you play 1 vs 1 in a head to head match. The full game will enable one to play up to 6 friends with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Arenas_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle it out in a single arenas for the demo. The full game will offer more, each offering its own edge-of-your-seat challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Blade Blitz experience by toggling Friendly Fire on or off.\u00a0 We support a wide range of controllers, including Xbox, PlayStation, Switch, and many more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629420?t=1745306454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/33f2610b928a0e71a12dad68587f30eec1a42dfe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745306454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/ee7837caf571bff9dccd186365fcd0d1681b47e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745306454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/ee7837caf571bff9dccd186365fcd0d1681b47e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745306454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Controls_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering Blade Blitz Demo is a breeze with intuitive controls enabling you  to start slicing and dicing with just a joystick and two buttons. It's recommended you enjoy the demo's tutorial before jumping in to understand the rules of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Local_Multiplayer_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Couch Competitive Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blade Blitz Demo let's you play 1 vs 1 in a head to head match. The full game will enable one to play up to 6 friends with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629420/extras/Arenas_1.gif?t=1745306454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Arenas</strong></h2